
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Atelier</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap');

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
    background:#f8f5ef;
    color:#1c1a17;
    font-family:Inter,sans-serif;
}

header{
    padding:30px 6%;
    border-bottom:1px solid #d9d3c8;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
}

.logo{
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond";
    font-size:30px;
}

nav a{
    margin-left:25px;
    color:#625d54;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.hero{
    padding:130px 7%;
    text-align:center;
}

.hero small{
    letter-spacing:4px;
    color:#847d70;
}

h1{
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond";
    font-size:clamp(75px,12vw,170px);
    line-height:.75;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:40px 0;
}

h1 em{font-weight:500}

.hero p{
    max-width:500px;
    margin:auto;
    color:#716b62;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.editorial{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:0 6% 100px;
}

.article{
    border-top:1px solid #d9d3c8;
    padding:35px 0;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:180px 1fr;
}

.article span{
    color:#8c8579;
    font-size:13px;
}

.article h2{
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond";
    font-size:48px;
}

.article p{
    margin-top:10px;
    color:#777066;
}

footer{
    border-top:1px solid #d9d3c8;
    padding:30px;
    text-align:center;
}

@media(max-width:650px){
    nav div:last-child{display:none}
    .article{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .article span{margin-bottom:15px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">Atelier.</div>
<div>
<nav>
<a href="#">Journal</a>
<a href="#">Studio</a>
<a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<small>THE DIGITAL JOURNAL</small>
<h1>Ideas worth<br><em>remembering.</em></h1>
<p>
Stories, design and technology from an independent
creative studio.
</p>
</section>

<section class="editorial">

<div class="article">
<span>01 / DESIGN</span>
<div>
<h2>The beauty of simplicity</h2>
<p>Why restraint can create stronger digital experiences.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="article">
<span>02 / CULTURE</span>
<div>
<h2>Designing for humans</h2>
<p>Technology becomes meaningful when people come first.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="article">
<span>03 / FUTURE</span>
<div>
<h2>The next internet</h2>
<p>Exploring where digital experiences are heading.</p>
</div>
</div>

</section>

<footer>ATELIER — CRYSTAL WORKS STUDIOS</footer>

</body>
</html>

